    "content" : "dynamical delocalization result. However, assumption (1.3) is stronger than simply assuming the spectrum is AC, and this stronger assumption seems to be essentially necessary for ergodicity, see [7, Prp. 1.5] for a related result."
  }, {
    "type" : "paragraph",
